<title>CROATIA: TABLE - CROATIA'S Q1 CURRENT ACCOUNT DEFICIT WIDENS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CROATIA'S Q1 CURRENT ACCOUNT DEFICIT WIDENS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>						JAN-MARCH  JAN-MARCH 96</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE (million USD)   -680.7	  -238</p>
<p> -Goods					-844.9	  -580</p>
<p> -Services				     59.2	   142</p>
<p> -Income					-77.3	   -33</p>
<p> -Current transfers			 182.2	   233</p>
<p>NOTES -- The 1996 current account gap had shrunk to $1.45 billion thanks to a rise in the services balance from $1.71 billion a year earlier. -- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
